WEBVTT

00:01.715 --> 00:03.052
(The tassel crowns the knight. The sword is snow white.)

00:03.076 --> 00:04.411
(In the silver saddle, he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.435 --> 00:07.651
(He kills a man within ten steps. Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.675 --> 00:13.235
(He would leave once it's done. No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.235 --> 01:31.195
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.355 --> 01:34.595
=Episode 11=

02:35.420 --> 02:37.295
This is the transmission of Dahuangting.

02:38.745 --> 02:41.305
Sure enough, Wudang has pledged allegiance to North Liang.

02:43.595 --> 02:44.315
Your Grace.

02:44.370 --> 02:45.595
This is our chance now.

02:45.975 --> 02:47.095
How is that?

02:47.775 --> 02:49.071
If we stop them now,

02:49.095 --> 02:51.546
the internal force will render Xu Fengnian's meridians disorderly,

02:51.570 --> 02:52.945
and he will be ruined.

02:53.420 --> 02:54.471
Just a moment, Your Grace.

02:54.495 --> 02:55.720
But if you do this,

02:55.775 --> 02:57.270
Xu Xiao will hate you.

02:59.855 --> 03:01.320
How can we depend on Xu Xiao?

03:01.975 --> 03:02.975
Good.

03:04.245 --> 03:05.305
If you make it,

03:05.530 --> 03:06.746
the court will issue a decree

03:06.770 --> 03:08.170
and make you the master of Wudang.

03:09.895 --> 03:10.895
Thanks.

03:13.320 --> 03:14.320
Let's do it together.

03:46.820 --> 03:48.060
Who is that?

03:52.020 --> 03:53.340
Brother Wang.

03:53.735 --> 03:55.655
How did you come out of the Purple Bamboo Forest?

03:57.045 --> 03:58.135
Don't go any farther.

04:00.535 --> 04:01.535
If we don't stop them,

04:01.935 --> 04:03.975
Master Chonglou will lose all his force.

04:12.770 --> 04:15.730
It's his own decision.

04:25.870 --> 04:27.230
There isn't much time left.

05:36.595 --> 05:37.595
It's done.

05:37.870 --> 05:38.870
It's too late.

05:46.815 --> 05:47.815
Your Grace.

05:48.345 --> 05:49.785
It's destined that it can't be done.

05:50.720 --> 05:51.770
Let's go.

05:53.095 --> 05:54.775
You ruined Wudang!

05:56.775 --> 05:57.775
Little Taoist.

05:57.920 --> 05:59.280
Do you want to come down with us?

06:02.045 --> 06:03.045
Your Grace.

06:03.695 --> 06:04.770
I won't go with you.

06:05.245 --> 06:07.220
Master Chonglou lost all his force.

06:07.455 --> 06:09.120
Wudang will elect a new master.

06:09.455 --> 06:10.470
I'd like to try it.

06:10.870 --> 06:12.070
If I could be the master,

06:12.570 --> 06:13.810
maybe I could turn the tide.

06:15.535 --> 06:16.535
Very good.

06:16.895 --> 06:17.895
Rest assured.

06:18.175 --> 06:20.455
The court will fully support you to take over Wudang.

06:23.775 --> 06:24.775
Thank you, Your Grace.

06:26.015 --> 06:27.595
Xu Fengnian will wake up soon.

06:27.975 --> 06:30.070
Please leave as soon as possible.

06:31.695 --> 06:32.695
Um.

07:04.015 --> 07:05.645
You acted well.

07:07.495 --> 07:09.245
There was more action than talk.

07:09.775 --> 07:10.815
It was not that difficult.

07:15.455 --> 07:17.070
Let's check Master Chonglou.

07:31.655 --> 07:32.655
Master Chonglou.

07:33.520 --> 07:34.895
Did it go well?

07:35.415 --> 07:36.945
The Princess should have believed it.

07:38.345 --> 07:40.870
Use the force of North Liang as a deterrent to Mount Longhu,

07:42.270 --> 07:44.345
then with the support of the capital,

07:45.445 --> 07:47.855
it will be a sure thing

07:48.135 --> 07:49.995
for you to take over Wudang.

07:50.775 --> 07:51.775
Master Chonglou.

07:52.245 --> 07:53.745
Don't be sullen.

07:55.015 --> 07:56.711
Use my Dahuangting

07:56.735 --> 07:58.545
to change for the future for Wudang.

07:59.345 --> 08:00.575
It's worth it.

08:02.195 --> 08:04.620
Do you know why

08:05.935 --> 08:07.770
the Shentu Sword

08:08.595 --> 08:10.770
was given to you?

08:12.735 --> 08:13.735
To guard Wudang.

08:15.295 --> 08:17.270
The world is turbulent.

08:18.070 --> 08:21.020
Before you become the best in the world,

08:21.945 --> 08:23.520
we must count on you

08:23.895 --> 08:25.695
to guard Wudang

08:26.375 --> 08:27.845
with this mahogany sword.

08:29.975 --> 08:30.975
I'll live and die

08:31.620 --> 08:32.620
with Wudang.

08:35.545 --> 08:37.120
You go up first.

08:38.415 --> 08:40.245
Gather your fellow apprentices.

08:41.470 --> 08:43.370
I have something to say.

08:44.135 --> 08:45.420
What about you, Master Chonglou?

08:46.845 --> 08:48.470
I'll wait for him to wake up.

08:50.970 --> 08:51.970
Go ahead.

09:18.415 --> 09:19.415
Your Grace.

09:19.695 --> 09:20.895
We've seen no pursuers.

09:21.335 --> 09:22.272
Let's go back to the capital now.

09:22.296 --> 09:23.535
Yes, Your Grace.

09:26.255 --> 09:27.255
Should we send a message

09:27.320 --> 09:28.471
to the capital right now

09:28.495 --> 09:30.775
that Xu Fengnian got the internal force?

09:32.335 --> 09:33.895
Xu Fengnian is nothing but a fool.

09:34.735 --> 09:36.255
So what that he acquired martial arts?

09:37.020 --> 09:38.460
In terms of the momentum of history,

09:38.975 --> 09:40.111
one person's capability

09:40.135 --> 09:41.135
is not worth mentioning.

09:41.720 --> 09:43.270
You are quite right, Your Grace.

09:44.345 --> 09:46.375
Send the message about Wudang back now.

09:46.855 --> 09:47.472
One thing is for sure

09:47.496 --> 09:49.096
that Wudang has defected to North Liang.

09:49.415 --> 09:51.055
Ask Mount Longhu not to be too aggressive.

09:51.535 --> 09:52.821
We can't provoke Xu Xiao

09:52.845 --> 09:53.845
just for a little sect.

09:54.295 --> 09:55.320
Yes, Your Grace.

09:55.735 --> 09:58.135
I will send a message to the capital immediately.

09:58.495 --> 09:59.495
Um.

10:02.695 --> 10:03.695
And also,

10:04.935 --> 10:06.655
Hong Xixiang's heart is with the capital.

10:07.615 --> 10:08.975
We should support him

10:09.815 --> 10:11.045
to take over Wudang.

10:44.070 --> 10:45.445
Why are my clothes not wet?

10:46.995 --> 10:48.745
The water has been evaporated.

10:50.975 --> 10:52.020
You lit a fire?

10:53.615 --> 10:55.695
The genuine spirit works better than fire.

10:59.770 --> 11:01.495
You've passed Dahuangting to me?

11:03.595 --> 11:04.645
Yes.

11:09.815 --> 11:11.495
I don't feel any difference.

11:15.615 --> 11:18.545
Looks like you are compatible with my genuine spirit.

11:41.055 --> 11:43.545
As for how much of the genuine spirit you can keep,

11:44.415 --> 11:46.670
it depends on your fate.

12:01.215 --> 12:02.215
Thank you.

12:02.945 --> 12:04.231
You want to go up to the mountain?

12:04.255 --> 12:05.255
Let me help you.

12:07.595 --> 12:09.070
Thank you.

12:19.135 --> 12:20.845
In order to protect Wudang,

12:20.995 --> 12:22.720
I threw

12:22.870 --> 12:24.020
my life away.

12:25.045 --> 12:26.345
Wudang

12:26.615 --> 12:29.455
is not a big sect, but it's not small, either.

12:29.775 --> 12:33.370
It's even hard for us to survive in this world.

12:34.175 --> 12:36.470
How hard the lives would be

12:38.095 --> 12:40.645
for the common people?

12:42.695 --> 12:45.095
If one day

12:46.995 --> 12:49.175
you take over North Liang,

12:50.470 --> 12:52.455
please

12:53.595 --> 12:55.615
consider them.

12:57.335 --> 12:58.335
I will.

13:01.895 --> 13:03.295
Why are you waiting here?

13:04.375 --> 13:05.615
To help you go up the mountain.

13:06.855 --> 13:07.855
Good.

13:08.375 --> 13:10.370
Then I won't trouble Your Highness.

13:11.095 --> 13:12.095
Yeah.

13:12.535 --> 13:14.320
It's almost the end of the year.

13:15.015 --> 13:17.120
You should go back to North Liang.

13:17.655 --> 13:19.295
You knew about the passing of Dahuangting?

13:20.135 --> 13:21.695
Please

13:21.895 --> 13:23.255
don't waste it.

13:24.320 --> 13:26.920
I'll wait for the news that you set foot in Wudi City.

13:27.370 --> 13:28.595
Come on.

13:54.855 --> 13:55.920
Your Grace.

13:56.545 --> 13:57.545
Um.

13:59.175 --> 14:00.831
I'll get some hot water

14:00.855 --> 14:02.545
to make tea for you.

14:10.995 --> 14:12.445
Why are you following me?

14:12.720 --> 14:14.711
You should guard Her Grace now!

14:14.735 --> 14:15.735
Yes.

14:29.815 --> 14:31.220
Fill it with hot water.

14:32.615 --> 14:33.615
How is it going?

14:33.935 --> 14:35.195
Things have changed.

14:36.135 --> 14:37.135
What happened?

14:37.215 --> 14:39.151
That person was taken away by the people of Mount Longhu.

14:39.175 --> 14:40.775
It should be written by Jian Jiuhuang.

14:42.120 --> 14:43.097
And His Highness...

14:43.121 --> 14:44.361
What's wrong with His Highness?

14:44.495 --> 14:45.551
Wang Chonglou

14:45.575 --> 14:48.055
passed Dahuangting to him.

14:48.815 --> 14:50.670
Princess Suizhu has believed

14:51.135 --> 14:53.595
that Wudang has pledged allegiance to North Liang.

14:55.295 --> 14:56.545
To protect themselves?

14:56.975 --> 14:58.470
Aside from this accident,

14:58.595 --> 15:00.515
everything else went on just as you expected.

15:00.935 --> 15:02.271
Princess Suizhu

15:02.295 --> 15:04.871
saw with her own eyes that His Highness is obstreperous and stupid.

15:04.895 --> 15:06.046
From now on,

15:06.070 --> 15:09.150
the capital won't be wary of His Highness.

15:10.720 --> 15:11.720
By the way.

15:11.815 --> 15:13.120
Father wants me to ask you

15:14.095 --> 15:15.920
if you want to find a chance

15:16.215 --> 15:17.255
to go back to North Liang.

15:17.575 --> 15:19.111
My stay in the capital

15:19.135 --> 15:21.320
will help His Lordship more.

15:22.575 --> 15:23.845
Thank you.

15:24.815 --> 15:25.815
I'll leave.

15:36.455 --> 15:37.595
Your Grace.

15:38.495 --> 15:39.545
We are ready to go.

15:40.270 --> 15:41.270
Did you pay for it?

15:41.535 --> 15:42.321
Yes.

15:42.345 --> 15:43.345
Five pennies.

15:45.655 --> 15:47.245
It's not easy for these people.

15:49.455 --> 15:50.895
Send five more pennies to the owner.

15:57.597 --> 16:00.738
(Tea)

16:01.245 --> 16:01.972
Sir.

16:01.996 --> 16:03.596
Is there anything else I can do for you?

16:07.895 --> 16:08.895
Your tip.

16:10.455 --> 16:11.895
Thank you very much.

16:17.775 --> 16:18.775
Your Grace.

16:18.935 --> 16:20.215
The money has been given to him.

16:25.375 --> 16:26.170
Let's go.

16:26.345 --> 16:27.345
Yes.

16:36.745 --> 16:38.670
Sun Diaosi is right.

16:39.575 --> 16:40.855
Princess Suizhu

16:41.370 --> 16:43.220
is suspicious deep down

16:44.195 --> 16:46.245
in spite of her unruly behavior.

16:50.695 --> 16:51.791
Don't leave anything!

16:51.815 --> 16:53.245
Burn everything you see!

16:58.070 --> 16:59.032
Let's go to Wudang

16:59.056 --> 17:00.370
and take His Highness home!

17:30.575 --> 17:32.145
Wang Chonglou is daring indeed.

17:33.855 --> 17:35.295
I wasn't expecting this, either.

17:38.655 --> 17:40.570
Two months is up.

17:41.215 --> 17:42.215
I should probably leave.

17:45.055 --> 17:46.655
You won't go back to North Liang with me?

17:48.670 --> 17:51.020
Everyone has his path.

17:53.015 --> 17:54.520
We have to say goodbye

17:55.015 --> 17:56.195
to those we meet on the way.

17:57.195 --> 17:58.795
This is the world of martial arts.

18:08.935 --> 18:10.470
Thank you for your teachings.

18:19.220 --> 18:20.470
Keep practicing martial arts.

18:22.415 --> 18:23.595
Maybe we will meet again.

18:27.995 --> 18:28.995
I'm leaving.

19:06.479 --> 19:09.711
(Sanqing Hall)

19:09.735 --> 19:10.845
Here you are.

19:11.270 --> 19:12.350
- Master. - Master.

19:13.770 --> 19:14.770
Good.

19:26.215 --> 19:27.745
From today on,

19:28.045 --> 19:29.720
Wudang has

19:30.445 --> 19:32.620
survived the calamity of extermination.

19:33.255 --> 19:36.070
I only have one thing to tell you.

19:37.735 --> 19:39.145
After my death,

19:40.735 --> 19:42.020
Hong Xixiang

19:42.335 --> 19:44.620
will take over Wudang and become the master.

19:45.535 --> 19:46.695
Master Chonglou.

20:23.055 --> 20:24.670
I think I can't erase it.

20:29.295 --> 20:31.095
This is Dahuangting.

20:32.655 --> 20:33.655
Jiang Ni.

20:34.120 --> 20:36.695
Do you think I shouldn't have come to Wudang?

20:39.815 --> 20:41.511
Don't complain when it's in your interest.

20:41.535 --> 20:43.120
Pass it to me if you don't want it.

20:45.445 --> 20:47.645
I'll die if I pass it to you.

20:48.920 --> 20:50.080
That would be the best.

20:52.195 --> 20:53.695
Besides, I don't know how to pass it.

21:07.895 --> 21:09.045
Your Highness!

21:09.520 --> 21:10.570
Your Highness!

21:12.820 --> 21:14.720
Your Highness, have you missed me?

21:15.815 --> 21:17.945
I miss you so much!

21:19.020 --> 21:19.947
Your Highness!

21:19.971 --> 21:21.070
Jiang Ni.

21:21.895 --> 21:22.895
It's time to go home.

21:23.855 --> 21:24.855
Your Highness!

21:28.320 --> 21:29.320
Your Highness!

21:29.595 --> 21:30.945
Fatty Lushan is coming!

21:36.455 --> 21:38.415
You can stay here for a few more days if you want.

21:39.195 --> 21:40.320
Your Highness!

21:41.175 --> 21:42.175
That won't be necessary.

22:08.595 --> 22:09.621
Master Wang said

22:09.645 --> 22:11.605
it will take him too long to go down the mountain,

22:11.895 --> 22:13.320
so he won't come to bid farewell.

22:15.170 --> 22:16.545
Tell him for me

22:16.935 --> 22:18.111
I won't forget

22:18.135 --> 22:19.145
what I owe Wudang.

22:19.855 --> 22:20.855
Um.

22:23.095 --> 22:25.095
This is Wudang's book on practicing genuine spirit.

22:25.815 --> 22:27.431
(Treatise of the Most Exalted One) You have Dahuangting now.

22:27.455 --> 22:29.535
(Treatise of the Most Exalted One) It might help you.

22:32.775 --> 22:33.795
Goodbye then.

22:37.175 --> 22:38.245
Here is one thing.

22:39.375 --> 22:40.991
Don't tear down the hut

22:41.015 --> 22:42.071
and grow some vegetables for me

22:42.095 --> 22:43.320
in the garden.

22:46.575 --> 22:47.575
What kind of vegetables?

22:48.615 --> 22:50.070
Just like before.

22:51.335 --> 22:52.995
Do you want me to steal vegetables again?

22:54.295 --> 22:55.870
You're the next master.

22:56.175 --> 22:57.175
It's not hard.

22:58.255 --> 23:01.070
You'd better leave now.

23:17.470 --> 23:18.470
What?

23:19.655 --> 23:20.935
Do you know how to ride a horse?

23:21.135 --> 23:22.495
I don't. So what?

23:24.375 --> 23:25.470
Nothing.

23:27.470 --> 23:28.470
Eh!

23:29.470 --> 23:30.815
Get down!

23:31.270 --> 23:32.311
How do you go back to North Liang

23:32.335 --> 23:33.495
if I get down?

23:34.095 --> 23:35.720
I'll learn by myself.

23:36.575 --> 23:38.870
I've restored the hut and the garden for you.

23:39.970 --> 23:41.431
It has nothing to do with me.

23:41.455 --> 23:43.335
I have one more thing to ask you before I leave!

23:43.855 --> 23:44.855
Go ahead.

23:45.535 --> 23:47.345
When exactly are you going to Jiangnan?

23:51.215 --> 23:53.135
You don't even have the courage to see my sister?

23:55.575 --> 23:57.020
When I become the best in the world,

23:57.295 --> 23:58.351
I will be able to go down the mountain.

23:58.375 --> 23:59.535
After I go down the mountain,

23:59.935 --> 24:00.935
I'll go to see her.

24:01.495 --> 24:02.920
The best in the world?

24:03.295 --> 24:04.295
How long will it take?

24:06.375 --> 24:07.545
It's gonna happen.

24:12.345 --> 24:13.505
Let's go back to North Liang.

24:41.095 --> 24:41.911
They've left.

24:41.935 --> 24:42.935
Um.

24:44.015 --> 24:45.345
They asked you to go to Jiangnan?

24:45.795 --> 24:46.795
Master Chonglou.

24:47.345 --> 24:49.021
I do like Xu Zhihu.

24:49.045 --> 24:49.645
Um.

24:49.975 --> 24:51.420
But I also like Wudang.

24:51.820 --> 24:52.752
I'm not going to leave here

24:52.776 --> 24:54.256
until I become the best in the world.

24:59.455 --> 25:00.645
It must be hard for you.

25:02.695 --> 25:03.745
It's not hard.

25:04.695 --> 25:05.995
I'm just worried

25:06.415 --> 25:08.320
that you place all your hope on me,

25:09.455 --> 25:11.295
but what if I can't be the best in the world?

25:12.820 --> 25:13.820
Eh?

25:16.415 --> 25:19.855
We haven't had a match for years.

25:20.415 --> 25:21.415
Well.

25:21.855 --> 25:23.620
Why don't we do it today?

25:25.255 --> 25:26.495
I don't think it's a good idea.

25:26.855 --> 25:27.970
Are you scared?

25:29.975 --> 25:30.975
Let's do it then.

25:32.335 --> 25:33.335
Okay.

25:52.895 --> 25:53.896
Well, Master Chonglou.

25:53.920 --> 25:55.345
I'm more energetic than you, right?

25:56.645 --> 25:59.295
I don't have Dahuangting anymore.

25:59.495 --> 26:01.720
That was a glorious defeat.

26:02.170 --> 26:03.655
What does that

26:03.855 --> 26:05.745
have anything to do with Dahuangting?

26:10.195 --> 26:11.375
Xixiang.

26:12.970 --> 26:15.245
Just feel free to be yourself.

26:15.815 --> 26:18.455
Our master and I won't make a mistake.

26:19.220 --> 26:21.935
You will be the best in the world.

26:23.345 --> 26:25.375
When you come down the mountain,

26:26.220 --> 26:27.831
you must leave in a grand way

26:27.855 --> 26:29.415
and make me

26:29.695 --> 26:30.975
look good!

26:36.395 --> 26:37.395
Okay!

26:38.470 --> 26:40.055
The best in the world!

26:59.237 --> 27:03.920
(Apricot Flower Wine Shop)

27:14.695 --> 27:16.170
You're finally back, Your Highness.

27:18.175 --> 27:20.045
Is this the mark of Dahuangting?

27:21.335 --> 27:22.970
It looks good on you.

27:23.570 --> 27:24.570
Do you all know it?

27:24.855 --> 27:26.495
We got the message.

27:26.770 --> 27:29.290
Congratulations on being endowed with civil and martial virtues.

27:29.895 --> 27:30.951
You must be tired.

27:30.975 --> 27:32.071
Please get inside and have some rest.

27:32.095 --> 27:33.095
Eh?

27:33.175 --> 27:34.970
Why are you all waiting outside?

27:37.695 --> 27:39.070
Something happened in the mansion.

27:39.375 --> 27:40.670
Let's go inside first.

27:51.570 --> 27:52.470
Son.

27:52.575 --> 27:54.020
You are finally back.

28:00.455 --> 28:02.370
Wang Chonglou

28:02.455 --> 28:03.920
is decisive indeed.

28:04.215 --> 28:06.520
He actually passed his Dahuangting to you.

28:06.820 --> 28:07.520
Never mind.

28:07.815 --> 28:08.870
Never mind.

28:09.175 --> 28:10.032
You must be hungry now.

28:10.056 --> 28:11.820
Look what I got for you.

28:12.455 --> 28:13.072
There are more.

28:13.096 --> 28:14.551
I found this good stuff for you.

28:14.575 --> 28:15.845
I don't want to eat.

28:16.095 --> 28:18.046
What happened in the mansion?

28:18.070 --> 28:19.230
What are you doing here?

28:19.335 --> 28:20.395
Your Highness.

28:20.655 --> 28:21.951
It's nothing serious.

28:21.975 --> 28:23.311
Just to stay away from trouble.

28:23.335 --> 28:24.335
Stay away from trouble?

28:24.935 --> 28:27.295
The Lord of North Liang came here to stay away from trouble?

28:27.575 --> 28:28.855
Is there a ghost in the mansion?

28:29.995 --> 28:30.752
I wish

28:30.776 --> 28:31.970
it was a ghost.

28:32.745 --> 28:34.245
Your second sister is back.

28:38.535 --> 28:40.470
You told her that I'm learning martial arts?

28:40.595 --> 28:41.946
Do I need to tell her?

28:41.970 --> 28:43.495
The whole world knows it now.

28:44.820 --> 28:45.991
I'd better go back to Wudang and stay there for a few days.

28:46.015 --> 28:48.070
Wait, wait, you can't leave.

28:48.335 --> 28:49.445
Listen.

28:49.620 --> 28:50.631
I've told her

28:50.655 --> 28:52.111
that you're on your way back to North Liang.

28:52.135 --> 28:54.471
She is waiting for you at home.

28:54.495 --> 28:55.711
Xu Xiao!

28:55.735 --> 28:57.845
You sold me out!

28:58.095 --> 28:59.270
I have to save

28:59.535 --> 29:01.195
one of us.

29:02.695 --> 29:04.070
It's not necessary.

29:35.455 --> 29:36.670
Do you see her?

29:38.895 --> 29:40.120
She should be in my yard.

29:40.535 --> 29:41.751
Go back to your rooms.

29:41.775 --> 29:42.815
I'll go to see her myself.

29:56.595 --> 29:57.595
Stay here!

30:17.545 --> 30:19.945
(Xu Weixiong, the second daughter of the Lord of North Liang)

30:22.375 --> 30:23.995
You're back to spend the New Year?

30:26.695 --> 30:28.231
(Artificers' Record) I made you a set of pieces with rocks

30:28.255 --> 30:29.845
(Artificers' Record) in Wudang.

30:30.455 --> 30:31.645
Take a look.

30:38.055 --> 30:38.872
You must be tired of reading.

30:38.896 --> 30:40.096
Let me massage your shoulders.

30:50.015 --> 30:51.321
Are you getting used to

30:51.345 --> 30:52.635
the life at Shangyin Academy?

30:54.055 --> 30:55.575
I heard you are learning martial arts.

30:58.695 --> 31:00.270
Old Huang died in Wudi City.

31:00.455 --> 31:02.020
I want to take his sword box back.

31:03.415 --> 31:05.015
You think it's bad to learn martial arts?

31:05.055 --> 31:06.370
- It's up to you. - Um.

31:07.215 --> 31:08.375
I just didn't expect

31:08.855 --> 31:10.231
that Old Huang is more important to you

31:10.255 --> 31:11.895
than North Liang.

31:14.095 --> 31:15.095
Why do you say that?

31:17.535 --> 31:18.820
Right now,

31:19.135 --> 31:21.370
you haven't even decided to take over the army of Xu.

31:22.975 --> 31:24.711
I don't think I'm up to

31:24.735 --> 31:25.871
such an important task.

31:25.895 --> 31:26.511
Enough!

31:26.535 --> 31:27.535
Weixiong.

31:28.655 --> 31:29.911
You can do

31:29.935 --> 31:30.672
whatever you want.

31:30.696 --> 31:32.345
Thank you for being so generous.

31:33.775 --> 31:35.071
Where are you going?

31:35.095 --> 31:37.796
(Wutong House)

31:37.820 --> 31:39.071
Don't be mad.

31:39.095 --> 31:40.551
I'll go back to Shangyin Academy right now.

31:40.575 --> 31:41.232
I won't be angry

31:41.256 --> 31:42.270
if I don't see you.

31:42.815 --> 31:44.070
You're going back now?

31:44.455 --> 31:45.920
Not to spend the New Year at home?

31:48.670 --> 31:50.191
I made it for you in person.

31:50.215 --> 31:51.320
Take a look, at least.

31:53.455 --> 31:54.455
I've seen it.

31:56.575 --> 31:58.570
I'm not a kid anymore!

31:59.935 --> 32:01.351
You all want me to take over North Liang!

32:01.375 --> 32:02.671
Have you asked me if I want to?

32:02.695 --> 32:04.295
Who are you to say no?

32:06.575 --> 32:09.015
Everyone should have the right to decide how to live his life!

32:09.695 --> 32:10.995
You know nothing!

32:11.415 --> 32:12.535
Your life is totally wasted!

32:12.615 --> 32:14.695
You can't even see your responsibility!

33:19.855 --> 33:20.870
Why are you here?

33:24.015 --> 33:26.070
I heard that you tried to kill Xu Fengnian again.

33:30.735 --> 33:31.775
You're afraid to admit it?

33:37.535 --> 33:38.535
Yes.

33:38.695 --> 33:40.045
I did try to kill him.

33:42.320 --> 33:43.320
Let me warn you.

33:44.170 --> 33:45.895
Don't forget who you are.

33:48.175 --> 33:49.175
Well.

33:49.295 --> 33:51.470
A maid can't assassinate the son of a lord?

33:55.295 --> 33:57.095
I'll say it one last time.

33:58.615 --> 34:00.470
If you hurt Xu Fengnian,

34:01.170 --> 34:03.050
I'll throw you into a well

34:03.595 --> 34:04.875
and close it.

34:05.920 --> 34:07.795
You'll just rot in the well

34:08.135 --> 34:10.045
and never see the sun again.

34:11.135 --> 34:12.420
If you understand my words,

34:12.815 --> 34:14.445
write it down

34:14.935 --> 34:15.772
and swear

34:15.796 --> 34:17.756
that you will never try to kill Xu Fengnian again.

34:19.775 --> 34:20.775
Okay.

34:21.335 --> 34:22.570
You want me to write it down?

34:23.215 --> 34:24.215
Bring me a brush.

34:24.775 --> 34:26.255
The bigger, the better.

34:32.895 --> 34:34.270
Remember what I said.

34:34.870 --> 34:36.095
I, Xu Weixiong,

34:36.375 --> 34:37.375
am a person

34:37.695 --> 34:39.045
of my words.

34:40.375 --> 34:41.375
What a coincidence,

34:41.735 --> 34:42.795
so am I.

36:18.995 --> 36:24.220
(Xu Fengnian)

36:33.575 --> 36:35.191
Miss Weixiong rode away

36:35.215 --> 36:36.620
and left Lingzhou.

36:37.655 --> 36:39.311
She came and left like the wind.

36:39.335 --> 36:40.272
It turns out

36:40.296 --> 36:41.945
she came all the way back

36:42.095 --> 36:43.520
just to scold me.

36:44.055 --> 36:46.445
Miss Weixiong has high expectations for you.

36:47.335 --> 36:48.351
She is the first prodigy

36:48.375 --> 36:50.395
at Shangyin Academy for decades.

36:50.895 --> 36:52.120
I'm no match for her,

36:52.415 --> 36:53.575
and I don't want to learn it.

36:55.255 --> 36:56.395
Did Jiang Ni write it?

36:56.620 --> 36:57.620
Um.

36:58.895 --> 36:59.995
Her handwriting is good.

37:11.455 --> 37:12.695
Chen Zhibao.

37:14.175 --> 37:15.645
You should have learnt a lot

37:15.895 --> 37:17.645
at Shangyin Academy.

37:18.295 --> 37:19.345
Why do you care

37:19.495 --> 37:20.645
what I learnt?

37:20.855 --> 37:21.792
You've learnt so much,

37:21.816 --> 37:23.245
but you are still so brutal.

37:25.095 --> 37:27.015
I think Shangyin Academy is a good place for you.

37:28.935 --> 37:29.935
So?

37:31.255 --> 37:33.055
So, you don't need to come back to North Liang

37:33.455 --> 37:34.995
if there is nothing important.

37:37.335 --> 37:39.845
Do you think I'm the cause of the chaos?

37:52.245 --> 37:53.245
Father.

37:53.575 --> 37:55.271
Chen Zhibao left the camp alone

37:55.295 --> 37:56.896
and stopped Miss Weixiong outside the city.

37:56.920 --> 37:57.920
Um.

38:00.255 --> 38:01.255
Father.

38:01.455 --> 38:02.670
Should we dispatch soldiers?

38:02.845 --> 38:03.712
They haven't seen each other for a long time.

38:03.736 --> 38:04.745
Don't disturb them.

38:53.270 --> 39:00.270
(Jiang Ni swears to kill Xu Fengnian)

39:07.655 --> 39:08.695
Why do you want to see me?

39:17.935 --> 39:19.320
Where is the mark of Dahuangting?

39:20.615 --> 39:22.551
There is no mark on Wang Chonglou

39:22.575 --> 39:23.775
when he doesn't use his force.

39:28.895 --> 39:29.895
What is this?

39:30.375 --> 39:32.215
It's Wudang's Treatise of the Most Exalted One.

39:32.415 --> 39:33.620
Hong Xixiang gave it to me.

39:33.975 --> 39:34.822
It's for you.

39:34.846 --> 39:36.290
I don't have Dahuangting.

39:36.375 --> 39:37.375
I'm too lazy to read.

39:37.535 --> 39:38.770
Why don't you read it to me?

39:39.455 --> 39:40.495
Don't even think about it.

39:40.895 --> 39:41.995
I'll give you one penny

39:42.175 --> 39:43.175
for each word.

39:43.720 --> 39:45.045
One penny?

39:45.415 --> 39:46.720
One penny for each word.

39:48.815 --> 39:49.535
Two pennies.

39:49.695 --> 39:50.695
Just one penny.

39:51.920 --> 39:53.031
(Treatise of the Most Exalted One)

39:53.055 --> 39:54.032
If you read more books,

39:54.056 --> 39:55.536
it can still cost me all of my money.

39:55.815 --> 39:56.945
There is more than one book?

39:57.215 --> 39:58.215
Think about it.

39:58.615 --> 39:59.775
I want to learn martial arts,

39:59.935 --> 40:01.095
so, I have to read books.

40:01.855 --> 40:04.770
Let's just use this book as an example.

40:05.175 --> 40:06.895
I asked Hongshu to roughly count it.

40:07.415 --> 40:08.870
It's about 6,000 words.

40:09.815 --> 40:10.722
After you read the whole book,

40:10.746 --> 40:12.226
I'll pay you seven strings of pennies

40:13.415 --> 40:14.745
to make a good start.

40:15.095 --> 40:16.455
It's to your profit.

40:23.045 --> 40:24.720
(Treatise of the Most Exalted One)

40:27.255 --> 40:28.391
Pay me every time after I finish one book.

40:28.415 --> 40:29.415
Okay.

40:35.620 --> 40:37.121
There was something undefined and complete,

40:37.145 --> 40:38.671
coming into existence before Heaven and Earth.

40:38.695 --> 40:40.351
How still it was and formless,

40:40.375 --> 40:41.575
abstruse and profound,

40:41.815 --> 40:42.792
standing alone.

40:42.816 --> 40:43.935
Too rigid.

40:44.335 --> 40:45.545
Read it with emotions.

40:47.470 --> 40:49.911
There was something undefined and complete,

40:49.935 --> 40:52.191
coming into existence before Heaven and Earth.

40:52.215 --> 40:53.470
Be more sedate.

40:54.255 --> 40:55.870
What do you want?

40:57.415 --> 40:59.270
I pay you to read for me.

40:59.655 --> 41:01.375
Shouldn't you read it well?

41:04.455 --> 41:05.670
I'm going out now.

41:06.455 --> 41:07.495
Keep reading

41:07.655 --> 41:08.745
and think about

41:08.935 --> 41:10.095
the best way to read it.

41:10.615 --> 41:12.015
I'll listen to it when I come back.

41:20.215 --> 41:21.645
Your handwriting is good.

41:23.535 --> 41:24.535
It's okay.

41:25.335 --> 41:26.871
My second sister snapped at you,

41:26.895 --> 41:27.995
but you swore to kill me.

41:28.735 --> 41:29.735
Is that appropriate?

41:30.415 --> 41:32.320
Xu Weixiong cares about you the most.

41:32.970 --> 41:34.231
She wouldn't care if I swear to kill her.

41:34.255 --> 41:35.255
She cares about me?

41:35.935 --> 41:36.991
She came all the way back

41:37.015 --> 41:38.270
just to scold me.

41:38.415 --> 41:40.215
That's because she is too disappointed in you.

41:47.575 --> 41:48.432
Why does she

41:48.456 --> 41:50.445
want me to take over North Liang so badly?

41:53.975 --> 41:55.335
What question is that?

41:58.015 --> 41:59.970
My second sister hates

42:00.135 --> 42:02.870
the inheriting system the most.

42:03.335 --> 42:04.631
She wants me to take over North Liang

42:04.655 --> 42:07.015
certainly not for continuing the bloodline of the Xu family.

42:07.455 --> 42:08.620
She must have other reasons.

42:10.575 --> 42:12.420
Then why don't you want to take over

42:12.575 --> 42:13.845
North Liang?

42:19.255 --> 42:20.670
I don't want to see

42:20.895 --> 42:22.995
people keep dying for this thing.

42:24.695 --> 42:26.295
But if you don't do anything,

42:26.455 --> 42:28.095
doesn't it mean that they die for nothing?

42:46.495 --> 42:47.645
Where are you going?

43:29.975 --> 43:32.695
♪ The flower of pain ♪

44:56.995 --> 45:01.095
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪
